---
import LandingButton from "./LandingButton.astro";
---

<section class="cta">
	<div class="panel">
		<div class="copy">
			<h2>Turn the model into a file.</h2>
			<p>Write a small CCL config, then keep the syntax rules open when you need exact parser behavior.</p>
			<div class="actions">
				<LandingButton href="/getting-started/" variant="primary" icon="right-arrow">
					Write your first file
				</LandingButton>
				<LandingButton href="/syntax-reference/" variant="secondary" icon="open-book">
					Open syntax rules
				</LandingButton>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="next-file" aria-label="Example first CCL file">
			<code>
				<span>project = first-ccl-file</span>
				<span class="depth-1">format = readable</span>
				<span class="depth-1">parser = same tree</span>
			</code>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.cta {
		padding: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5.5rem) 0 clamp(4rem, 8vw, 6rem);
	}

	.panel {
		position: relative;
		display: grid;
		gap: 1.5rem;
		align-items: center;
		padding-top: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
		border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--ccl-contrast) 42%, transparent);
	}

	@media (min-width: 58rem) {
		.panel {
			grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.95fr) minmax(16rem, 0.5fr);
			gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem);
		}
	}

	h2 {
		font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 5vw, 3.6rem);
		line-height: 1;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
		margin: 0;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}

	p {
		margin: 0.8rem 0 0;
		max-width: 48ch;
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
		font-size: var(--sl-text-lg);
		text-wrap: pretty;
	}

	.actions {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.85rem;
		justify-content: flex-start;
		margin-top: 1.5rem;
	}

	.next-file {
		border-radius: 12px;
		background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sl-color-gray-6) 72%, var(--sl-color-black));
		padding: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 1.35rem);
	}

	.next-file code {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.45rem;
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-1);
		font: 700 var(--sl-text-sm) / 1.4 "Fira Code", ui-monospace, monospace;
	}

	.next-file span {
		display: block;
	}

	.next-file .depth-1 {
		padding-left: clamp(1rem, 4vw, 1.6rem);
		color: var(--ccl-contrast-high);
	}
</style>
